Hsiao-Tsing?!

267
00:21:30,575 --> 00:21:31,700
Hsiao-Tsing?!

268
00:21:36,375 --> 00:21:42,330
Ilmu sihir!
Aku memerintahkanmu untuk membekukan!

269
00:21:43,941 --> 00:21:45,373
Membeku!

270
00:21:45,542 --> 00:21:47,064
Membeku!

271
00:21:47,242 --> 00:21:48,606
Membeku!

272
00:21:48,775 --> 00:21:50,331
Hsiao-Tsing, itu kau?

273
